5
00:00:10,814 --> 00:00:14,414
Level 1 is Say it: explain a
concept out loud. The examiner
checks you against your own pages.

6
00:00:15,214 --> 00:00:16,414
Start talking opens a live
AssemblyAI Voice Agent session.

7
00:00:17,559 --> 00:00:22,659
Examiner (live):
"Self-attention. First
question: In one or two
sentences, say what an
attention weight means."

8
00:00:23,692 --> 00:00:30,134
Learner (synthetic voice): "An
attention weight says how much one
token listens to another token before
the value vectors are averaged."

9
00:00:30,959 --> 00:00:37,209
Examiner (live): "That is correct,
you captured how it measures how much
one token listens to others. Why does
self-attention matter?"

10
00:00:38,234 --> 00:00:46,584
Learner (synthetic voice): "Without
self attention a token could not
compare itself with every other
token, so the model would lose
context across the sequence."

11
00:00:47,409 --> 00:00:48,595
Examiner (live): "That is
a partial answer."

12
00:00:48,595 --> 00:00:54,159
Examiner (live): "You noted tokens
can compare themselves, but you
missed that weights determine the
strength of that influence."

13
00:00:54,494 --> 00:00:59,694
Level cleared: +150 XP, stars, and
the proof cards it earned.

14
00:01:03,094 --> 00:01:07,294
Back on the map: 1 day streak,
Rank 1, 1 of 22 levels cleared.
